\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lead us, O Father, in the paths of peace;
\par Without Thy guiding hand we go astray,
\par And doubts appeal, and sorrows still increase;
\par Lead us through Christ, the true and living way.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Lead us, O Father, in the paths of truth;
\par Unhelped by Thee, in error's maze we grope,
\par While passion stains and folly dims our youth,
\par And age comes on uncheered by faith and hope.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lead us, O Father, in the paths of right;
\par Blindly we stumble when we walk alone,
\par Involved in shadows of a darksome night,
\par Only with Thee we journey safely on.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lead us, O Father, to Thy heavenly rest,
\par However rough and steep the path may be,
\par Through joy or sorrow, as Thou deemest best,
\par Until our lives are perfected in Thee. 
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

